# Railway builds this service with Nixpacks, per the "builder" field in
# railway.json — the path that has actually worked here since July.
#
# A Dockerfile at the repo root would otherwise take precedence and be used
# instead. That Dockerfile exists for people self-hosting a relay and has never
# been built by anything, so letting an unvalidated image become the deploy path
# for the one live relay is the wrong order to find out. Keeping it out of the
# upload leaves it available to `docker build .` while Railway carries on doing
# what it was doing.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
